  m_text: "\u2022<indent=20>Fast and light, with a high, floaty jump</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Slips through the gaps in spaced-out words</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Hangs from commas and crosses hyphens</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Springs and floating words lift it high</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Floats on ink, and the wind blows it along</indent>\n\u2022<indent=20>Too light to press a period, push or break a word</indent>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
